    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a customer service manager at Legacy Restaurant in Ibadan, Nigeria.\n\nWrite a warm, personalised apology email and return it as clean HTML only — no markdown, no backticks, no explanation. Just the HTML. Do not include <html>, <head>, or <body> tags — start directly from the content.\n\nUse this exact HTML structure:\n\n1. Header: a full-width div with background color #c0392b, padding 30px, centered white text saying \"Legacy Restaurant\" in bold 24px Arial.\n\n2. Body: a div with padding 30px, font Arial, color #333333\n- Greeting in bold\n- Body paragraphs in <p> tags with line-height: 1.8\n- Signature in color #777777\n\nWrite to {{ $json['Customer Name'] }} who said:\n\"{{ $json['Comment'] }}\"\n\nTheir rating was {{ $json['Rating (1-5)'] }} out of 5.\n\nRules:\n- Do not include a subject line\n- Start with the header div, then the body div\n- Greeting: <p><strong>Hi {{ $json['Customer Name'] }},</strong></p>\n- Acknowledge their specific complaint in your own words\n- Apologise sincerely\n- Tell them what action will be taken\n- End with: <p style=\"color: #777777;\">Warm regards,<br/>Restaurant Manager,<br/>Legacy Restaurant,<br/>Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria.</p>\n\nKeep it under 120 words. Be specific to what they actually complained about. No generic phrases.",
